{
  "sequence_id": "seq_098e260f231aa789",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It will be dangerous if the newcomers were to have a standoff with the target Ghoul..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I must go ahead and stop them even more than I'd have to go for a subordinate...."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We have our own way of doing things, so please give up."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "BUT ...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...or perhaps I should say, rank 1 sasaki, was it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The source of all this from the start was"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "that you couldn't control your subordinates, wasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And with that reason demanding \"hand over your data\"..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Is nothing more than tyranny, don't you think?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "sensei... let's go already... we don't have time for..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's just as you said; I mismanaged control..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Agree that telling you to freely show me your"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Precious data can only be called Tyranni- Cal..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "BUT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I do not want to expose my subordinates to danger due to my carelessness...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If we make an achievement then we will hand that over to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "IF YOU'D JUST GIVE US THE DATA..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "SIGH----"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Did you think it'd turn out alright if you just bowed your head...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How troublesome. Doing things like this..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Is that sort of thing fitting for a Ghoul Investiga- Tor?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Listen to me. You, all of you guys,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"YOU\" in particular."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Even if it were a human that's an \"upright investigator\" doing this sort of thing,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It'd be no good."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"Talk-                                                            "
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "WE HAVE AN INVESTIGA- TION."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Please accept it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "How's the situation looking?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "sensei..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So... I'm not sure if I'm a fan of the"
    }
  ],
